WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:05.040 line:10%
Èske ou janm mande tèt ou poukisa selil ou yo gen yon chaj elektrik negatif ?

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.000 line:10%
Ann antre anndan pou n gade manbràn nan.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.255 line:10%
Premyèman, ponp Na⁺/K⁺ la

4
00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:16.079 line:10%
sèvi ak enèji ATP pou pouse twa iyon Na⁺ soti deyò selil la.

5
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.233 line:10%
An menm tan, li rale de iyon K⁺ antre anndan,

6
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:24.079 line:10%
sa ki kreye gwo gradyan iyonik atravè manbràn nan.

7
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:29.191 line:10%
Apre sa, kanal fwit K⁺ yo kite iyon jòn sa yo

8
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:33.525 line:10%
gaye tounen deyò, sa ki ogmante

9
00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:35.279 line:10%
negativite ki anndan an.

10
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.585 line:10%
Gwo pwoteyin ki chaje negatif rete kwense paske

11
00:00:38.585 --> 00:00:40.639 line:10%
yo twò gwo pou yo travèse baryè a.

12
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.521 line:10%
Ansanm, faktè sa yo estabilize

13
00:00:42.521 --> 00:00:45.599 line:10%
potansyèl manbràn nan repo a nan anviwon −70 mV konstan.

14
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.040 line:10%
Kidonk, poukisa anndan an rete toupre −70 mV ?

15
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.758 line:10%
Potasyòm nan soti deyò, l ap swiv gradyan li jiskaske

16
00:00:51.758 --> 00:00:53.672 line:10%
anndan negatif la prèske rale l tounen,

17
00:00:53.672 --> 00:00:56.319 line:10%
epi li estabilize toupre potansyèl ekilib potasyòm nan.

18
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.349 line:10%
Epi chaj sa a se sèlman yon kouch fen ki kole ak manbràn nan,

19
00:00:59.349 --> 00:01:00.239 line:10%
tankou yon kondansatè.

20
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.800 line:10%
An rezime, twa fòs kenbe selil la

21
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.360 line:10%
toupre −70 mV.

22
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.840 line:10%
Ponp Na⁺/K⁺ la bati gradyan yo.

23
00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:10.170 line:10%
Apre sa, potasyòm nan soti atravè kanal

24
00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.068 line:10%
fwit yo, epi gwo pwoteyin ki chaje

25
00:01:12.068 --> 00:01:13.519 line:10%
negatif rete kwense anndan.

